 and bought bills to relieve the selling pressure on the market. He said those bills might be used in Wednesday's reverse repo auction. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-11-96 \par \par \uc2  1304GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsbj010cn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
