\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 's Lira Dn Vs Dollar Despite Cntl Bnk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 November 1996\par 11:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira was down against the dollar in midday trading Tuesday as demand for dollars moved rates higher and prompted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Market players said the bank sold dollars to banks by telephone and could also be the anonymous seller on electronic trading screens. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's 182-day bill auction by the Turkish Treasury is another source of worry. Market players are aware that if the treasury sells less than its Wednesday repayment of 128 trillion lira, it will bring another dollar buying wave. \par \par \uc2  Around 1000 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 97,900 lira; \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  began at 97,930 lira. Due to Veterans Day holiday in the U.S., Monday's quotes were with Tuesday settlements and were at 98,100 lira. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' minimum reserve requirements was at 97,700 lira, up from Tuesday morning's 97,650 lira. \par \par \uc2  A trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might want to keep the dollar rate around 97,750 lira for Tuesday, which would correspond to a monthly lira depreciation of 6.5% for November against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket comprising of one dollar and 1.5 Deutsche marks. \par \par \uc2  'The lira depreciation should have accelerated towards the year end anyway,' said Uruz Ersoz, treasury manager at Osmanli Bankasi in Istanbul. 'This is what's happening.' \par \par \uc2  He added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't object to lira's depreciation, but wants to keep the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under control. \par \par \uc2  'If the politicians don't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , there will be a smooth depreciation by the year end,' Ersoz said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-11-96 \par \par \uc2  1022GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsbc00t2t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
