\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey's Lira/New Govt -3:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Guide Path \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 1996\par 16:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The government would be the first in Turkey's modern, secular history to be led by an Islamist party. The risk premium alone should push the lira higher against the dollar, the analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Erbakan's Welfare Party led national elections last December with 21% of the vote. It wasn't asked to form a government, however, until an attempted colaition between Ciller's True Path and its rival centrist party, the Motherland, failed last month. \par \par \uc2  But while they agreed the Islamist-led government - once it's confirmed by a vote of confidence - could bring pressure on the lira, they declined to forecast where the dollar-lira rate might go. \par \par \uc2  'We shouldn't forget the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' warned Ergin of Chase Bank. 'Next week, we're going to see \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  With about $16 billion in foreign reserves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey is expected to use a combination of higher money market rates and direct \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to guard the lira against sharp movements. \par \par \uc2  How high the lira might go against the dollar depends on the strength of the speculation, the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is comfortable, and policy pronouncements from the new government - a combination of factors analysts said is very difficult to predict. \par \par \uc2  'There will be some pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market...(but) the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a relatively huge amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves,' said Haluk Corbacioglu, a senior dealer for Societe Generale in Istanbul. 'We don't know the level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has in mind.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-07-96 \par \par \uc2  1423GMT \par \par \uc2  1198 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds7105dfd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
