\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 's Lira Unchanged With  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1996\par 11:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is unchanged against the dollar Wednesday as the demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last week was curbed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Some Treasury Bill investors, mainly banks, shifted to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to recent falls in the yield. \par \par \uc2  The dollar rate was over 68,200 lira when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered selling dollars at 68,100 lira and stabilized the market. \par \par \uc2  At 1020 GMT the dollar was quoted at 68,140 lira in the interbank market, slightly lower than Tuesday's range of 68,180 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate for the banks' minimum reserves has been unchanged at 67,730 lira. The market has opened with banks' requests for 13.2 trillion lira from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The banks are expected to partially cover their losses through Wednesday's 146-day Treasury Bill auction by demanding a maximum compounding yield of around 133%. Turkish Treasury has to pay 48.9 trillion on Thursday and another 45 trillion for salaries Friday. \par \par \uc2  'If the treasury agrees to increase the yields, then the banks will sell dollars to buy more T-bills,' said Umit Leblebici of Midland Bank NA in Istanbul. 'The Treasury needs to respond to the market demand as heavy payments are due in April'. \par \par \uc2  Despite the recent moves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's control in the market continues. 'The bank says - If there is need for lira depreciation, I will, and can do it' added Leblebici of Midland Bank. \par \par \uc2  T-bill auction results are watched as an indicator for the lira's rate as lower yields might again start another round of dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-03-96 \par \par \uc2  1058GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds3d027je\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
